WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.190
- As I mentioned that your new
album is called, Love Sucks,

00:00:02.190 --> 00:00:03.280
which, well, sometimes it does.

00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:04.477
- [Avril] Mhm. Let's face it

00:00:04.477 --> 00:00:06.430
- [Kelly] But I heard, ironically enough

00:00:06.430 --> 00:00:08.720
that you met your new
boyfriend while making it.

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:09.553
- [Avril] How funny is that?

00:00:09.553 --> 00:00:10.386
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:10.386 --> 00:00:11.219
- I went into the studio,

00:00:11.219 --> 00:00:13.810
I'm literally like, "Okay,
here's where I'm at."

00:00:13.810 --> 00:00:16.170
Like, I'm over love. I need a hot minute.

00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:19.750
Like, I'm like, I'm jaded
on love right now, like

00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:21.210
- [Kelly] Flick. Yeah, so.

00:00:21.210 --> 00:00:23.230
- [Avril] And like, so you
kind of have to like do

00:00:23.230 --> 00:00:24.660
that when you're in your writing sessions,

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:26.090
Just talk about like
where you're at and stuff.

00:00:26.090 --> 00:00:27.380
So I wrote that song, Love Sucks,

00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:29.763
set that, set the tone for this album.

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:33.225
Yeah, and then a couple like
days later I had a boyfriend.

00:00:33.225 --> 00:00:34.335
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:34.335 --> 00:00:36.174
- [Avril] That didn't
last long did it, Avril?

00:00:36.174 --> 00:00:38.390
(crowd clapping)

00:00:38.390 --> 00:00:39.798
- [Avril] I'm literally never single.

00:00:39.798 --> 00:00:42.340
- [Kelly] I know, but I love
that it's like, you're not

00:00:42.340 --> 00:00:44.260
wanting it. It wasn't even
like you're searching for it.

00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:46.020
- [Avril] It was like the
first time in my life.

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:48.640
like I had just like moved.

00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:51.170
And I moved out to Malibu,

00:00:51.170 --> 00:00:53.110
and I like was like starting my life over.

00:00:53.110 --> 00:00:54.930
And I was like, all right, like, I'm good.

00:00:54.930 --> 00:00:58.510
Like, I'm just gonna focus
on myself and like do me

00:00:58.510 --> 00:01:00.670
and just like, give it a break.

00:01:00.670 --> 00:01:02.280
Plus, I haven't had like the best luck,

00:01:02.280 --> 00:01:04.090
but I mean I've had amazing relationships,

00:01:04.090 --> 00:01:05.885
and they've been like
long term, and stuff.

00:01:05.885 --> 00:01:06.718
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:06.718 --> 00:01:08.610
- But like, I was just kinda,

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:10.710
like, I been focused on myself and it just

00:01:10.710 --> 00:01:11.950
like really didn't last

00:01:11.950 --> 00:01:12.783
- [Kelly] [Laughs] It happens.

00:01:12.783 --> 00:01:14.060
And you were like or I'll go on this date.

00:01:14.060 --> 00:01:15.070
Oh, that was awesome.

00:01:15.070 --> 00:01:16.058
Yeah.

00:01:16.058 --> 00:01:17.690
- [Avril] But made an album
called Love Sucks but it's also

00:01:17.690 --> 00:01:20.560
like super lighthearted
and like funny and fun.

00:01:20.560 --> 00:01:22.820
And it's like, kind of just
like the ups and downs in my

00:01:22.820 --> 00:01:25.630
life and love and just
like, it's a good time

00:01:25.630 --> 00:01:26.570
- [Kelly] which is relatable.

00:01:26.570 --> 00:01:29.040
- [Avril] Yeah. For a lot of
people and like my first album

00:01:29.040 --> 00:01:31.170
it's like, yeah. am I kind of
still writing the same ****

00:01:31.170 --> 00:01:34.140
but like you know, it's
like I was writing when

00:01:34.140 --> 00:01:36.890
I got out of high school
like fresh outta high school.

00:01:36.890 --> 00:01:40.542
Like just like having
crushes for the first time.

00:01:40.542 --> 00:01:41.375
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:41.375 --> 00:01:43.070
- And now on my seventh album

00:01:43.070 --> 00:01:45.410
it's like my, uh, you know I've had

00:01:45.410 --> 00:01:48.480
I've had experiences
I've lived, I've learned

00:01:48.480 --> 00:01:49.468
and, and no change

00:01:49.468 --> 00:01:51.430
- [Kelly] Well that's I think
it was a good thing though.

00:01:51.430 --> 00:01:52.263
- (Avril Laughing)

00:01:52.263 --> 00:01:55.140
- [Kelly] But, no, no, no And
apparently they stay the same

